The script already settled the deterministic cases: a removal with no
authorizing quote was refused, and a quote that did not resolve to the user's
own words was refused. This check STILL RUNS after a pure addition passes the
script — a script's own permit does not skip the checks after it, only a
refusal ends the chain — so read `pure_addition` first:

